        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW1SMTFBR, Offset Delaware Front Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Offset Traditional Delaware Pull is great as a front door handle or it can also be used as a commercial door pull on a store front. Choose from several beautiful finishes including matte black (pictured) and satin brass. This elegant door pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 18 inch or 24 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLW1SMTFBR Delaware Front Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW04-specifications.pdf?v=1704262327\"><b>First Impressions DLW1SMTFBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLW1018SMTFBR</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.39\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLW1024SMTFBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.39\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door handle is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths and Finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door pull, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Delaware Pull",
                "description": "The Offset Traditional Delaware Pull is great as a front door handle or it can also be used as a commercial door pull on a store front. Choose from several beautiful finishes including matte black (pictured) and satin brass. This elegant door pull can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from 18 inch or 24 inch lengths.\r\n",
